bāhunābhiṃ ca hṛdayaṃ śirastu vidhinā spṛśet |
āgneyaṃ paramaṃ sthānaṃ kuryācchuddhena bhasmanā ||

(**********) le |
saṃdhyāsu stryāsu saṃsparśe bhojanādikriyā sa ||

