divoddhūlayedaṅge tripuṇḍrādyairgṛ (****) ||

(**********) dhūlayeddvijaḥ |
spṛśedastreṇa mūrdhādimanyasnānāya bhasmanā ||

snāyādīśābhimamūrdhavaktrahṛdguhyavigrahāt |
