<p. 6>

divyāntarikṣabhūmiṣṭhān vighnān mūla (****) |
(**********) straiḥ pārṣṇighātaiśca dākṣiṇaiḥ ||

tribhiḥ sārya pādābhyāṃ dehalīmaspṛśan viśet |
