daśabāhuṃ viśālākṣaṃ nāgayajñopavītinam |
nīlanīrajanārā ca khaḍgākṣavalayābhayam ||

satriśūlaṃ rahasyoktaṃ dakṣiṇe pañcabāhavaḥ |

<p. 117>

bījapūraṃ dhanuścarmavaradaṇḍakamaṇḍalum |
